    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f4e",
      "text": "リリース日：[2013/12/25]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f4f",
      "text": "発売：[株式会社ポケモン]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f50",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f51",
      "text": "[https://x.com/pokemon_cojp/status/2087888150551056675?s=46 ポケモン公式]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f52",
      "text": ">【重要なお知らせ】",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f53",
      "text": ">[2027/02/26]（金）12時に、『ポケモンバンク』はサービスを終了いたします。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f54",
      "text": ">くわしくはこちらのお知らせをご覧ください。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f55",
      "text": ">https://www.pokemon.co.jp/info/2022/02/220216_gm01.html",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f56",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f57",
      "text": "[サービス終了]後は[GBA]・[DS]・[3DS]・[GC]の[ポケモン]から[Pokémon HOME]・[Nintendo Switch]宛にポケモンを移動できなくなる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f58",
      "text": "\t前世代でしか入手できない要素（特定のリボン等）は多々ある",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f59",
      "text": "\t[ニンテンドーeショップ]は[2023/03]にサービス終了しているため、新規入手は不可能",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f5a",
      "text": "\t\t購入済の場合、再ダウンロード可能",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7e94be0000000000b25f5b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1786680510,
      "updated": 1786680510
    },
    {
